{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-09-15 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER ANNOUNCES ACQUISITION OF THE ESPY CORPORATION, A LEADER IN SIGNAL INTELLIGENCE SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., SEPT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF THE ESPY CORPORATION ("ESPY"), WHICH WILL BECOME PART OF THE MICROWAVE PRODUCTS GROUP (MPG) WITHIN DOVER\'S ENGINEERED PRODUCTS SEGMENT.'}